'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Requirements==
Pick up and read [[Note about the Eye of the World]] from one of the following locations:
* In the "[[Dorm room 314 marked key|marked room]]" at the three-story dorms on [[Customs]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:They Are Already Here Customs Activation Location.png|Note on a stack of books
</gallery></li>
* In the "marked rooms" [[RB-BK marked key|RB-BK]], [[RB-VO marked key|RB-VO]] and [[RB-PKPM marked key|RB-PKPM]] on [[Reserve]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:They Are Already Here Reserve Activation Location 1.png|In RB-BK on the table with the pig carcass
File:They Are Already Here Reserve Activation Location 2.png|In RB-VO on the table with the pig carcass
File:They Are Already Here Reserve Activation Location 3.png|In RB-PKPM on the desk
</gallery></li>
* At the marked circle in the dilapidated village in the north of [[Woods]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:They Are Already Here Woods Activation Location Map.png|Circle location marked on map
File:The second ritual spot in the Woods.png|The marked circle
File:They Are Already Here Woods Activation Location.png|Note next to the burning candles
</gallery></li>
* In the house on the island on [[Shoreline]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:WetJob2IslandMap.png|Island location marked on map
File:EOTW Shoreline location.png|Note on the floor in the house
</gallery></li>

==Objectives==
* [[Note about the Eye of the World|Learn more]] about the hooded men/[[Note about the Eye of the World|Learn more]] about the people leaving strange symbols in Tarkov
* Locate a place connected to the Eye of the World
* [[Cult victim audio tape 2|Learn more]] about the cultist's victim from the torture room
* Locate the [[Cult victim's apartment key|cult victim's apartment]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain the [[Cult victim's apartment key|key]] to the apartment
* Investigate the victim's apartment
* Obtain the [[Cult victim audio tape 1|victim's first audio tape]]
* Obtain and read the [[Book of the Arrival|book]] that the cultists planted with Igor 
* Ask [[Mechanic]] about the Eye of the World
** (''Optional'') Gain access to [[Mechanic]]
* Locate and neutralize a [[Cultist priest]]
* Obtain more [[Cultist priest's note|information]] about the Eye of the World
* Locate the place marked with the Eye of the World on [[Lighthouse]]
* Investigate the ransacked cultist room in the chalet
** (''Optional'') Locate the [[Victim's note|victim's belongings]]
* Locate and obtain the [[Station 14-4 KORD Arshavin K. pass (Damaged)|key]] mentioned in the [[victim's note]]
* Locate the place marked with the Eye of the World on [[Woods]]
* [[Newspaper clipping from the cultists' house|Investigate]] the cultists' house marked with the Eye of the World
* Locate the place marked with the Eye of the World on [[Shoreline]]
* [[Programmer's note|Investigate]] the area around the Sordi communications tower
* [[Toolset|Repair]] the Sordi tower
* Restore [[Station 14-4 KORD Arshavin K. pass (Damaged)|Arshavin's keycard]]
* Gain [[Station 14-4 KORD Arshavin K. pass (Restored)|access]] to NGO Cobalt's secret facility
* Restore power at the station
* Turn on the cooling system in the server room
* Install a [[Secure Flash drive|flash drive]] to download the data
* [[Mysterious audio tape|Investigate]] ARRS Station 14-4 KORD thoroughly
* Survive and extract from [[Interchange]]
* [[ARRS station mechanic's notes|Find a way]] to disconnect the station from external agents
* Restore the ARRS station to backup settings
** (''Optional'') Check that the station power is turned on
* Collect the [[Flash drive for ARRS station|flash drive]] from the ARRS station
* Survive and extract from [[Interchange]]
* Hand over the [[Flash drive for ARRS station|flash drive with data]] to [[Mechanic]]
* Read the [[ARRS system specifications|ARRS station specifications]]

